# game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:5751
translate es Chit_Chat_54b73614:

    # "You try to chat, but no one really answers."
    "Intentas sacar platica, pero nadie realmente responde."

translate es strings:

    # Favorite-drink chit-chat openers (0.9)
    old "Ugh, you know what I could really go for right now?"
    new "Uf, ¿sabes qué se me antoja muchísimo ahora?"

    old "Can I be honest about what I'm craving?"
    new "¿Puedo ser sincera sobre lo que se me antoja?"

    old "Long day... it's got me thinking about how I like to unwind."
    new "Día largo... me tiene pensando en cómo me gusta relajarme."

    # Favorite-food chit-chat hints (0.9)
    old "Random, but I've been thinking about food all day."
    new "Random, pero llevo todo el día pensando en comida."

    old "Okay, don't judge me, but can we talk about food for a second?"
    new "Bueno, no me juzgues, pero ¿podemos hablar de comida un segundo?"

    old "I get way too excited about what I'm going to eat later."
    new "Me emociono demasiado con lo que voy a comer más tarde."

    old "Honestly? Nothing beats a good steak. I'm a total carnivore."
    new "¿Sinceramente? Nada le gana a un buen bistec. Soy carnívora total."

    old "Give me a juicy steak and I'm a happy girl. Red meat is my weakness."
    new "Dame un bistec jugoso y soy feliz. La carne roja es mi debilidad."

    old "Pasta is my ultimate comfort food. I could honestly eat it every day."
    new "La pasta es mi comida reconfortante favorita. En serio, comería todos los días."

    old "Carbs are life. A big bowl of pasta fixes any bad day for me."
    new "Los carbohidratos son vida. Un buen plato de pasta me arregla cualquier mal día."

    old "I could eat chicken a hundred different ways and never get bored."
    new "Podría comer pollo de cien formas distintas y nunca aburrirme."

    old "Grilled chicken is my safe order anywhere. Simple, but I love it."
    new "El pollo a la parrilla es mi pedido seguro en cualquier lado. Simple, pero me encanta."

    old "I try to keep it light lately... lots of salads and fresh stuff."
    new "Últimamente intento comer ligero... muchas ensaladas y cosas frescas."

    old "I'm kind of watching what I eat, so salad is usually my go-to."
    new "Estoy cuidando un poco lo que como, así que la ensalada suele ser mi opción."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:153
    old "The exam is still a while away, but don't let that fool you."
    new "El examen todavia esta lejos, pero no te confies."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:153
    old "We've got time before the next test. Just don't waste it all."
    new "Tenemos tiempo antes del proximo examen. Solo no lo desperdicies todo."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:153
    old "The exam isn't soon, but it sneaks up faster than you think."
    new "El examen no es tan pronto, pero llega mas rapido de lo que crees."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:161
    old "Might be a good idea to start reviewing early for once."
    new "Tal vez seria buena idea empezar a repasar temprano, al menos esta vez."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:161
    old "A little bit each day goes a long way, you know?"
    new "Un poquito cada dia hace mucha diferencia, sabias?"

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:161
    old "Let's not be the ones cramming the night before."
    new "No seamos de los que estudian todo la noche anterior."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:170
    old "The exam is getting closer... have you started preparing?"
    new "El examen se acerca... ya empezaste a estudiar?"

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:170
    old "We don't have that many days left before the test."
    new "No tenemos tantos dias antes del examen."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:170
    old "The exam is coming up. Don't wait until the last minute."
    new "El examen se acerca. No lo dejes para ultima hora."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:178
    old "Seriously, start reviewing if you haven't already."
    new "En serio, empieza a repasar si todavia no empezaste."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:178
    old "I'd rather not see you panic the night before."
    new "Prefiero no verte en panico la noche anterior."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:178
    old "Let's both make sure we're ready, okay?"
    new "Aseguremonos de que los dos estemos listos, ok?"

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:187
    old "The exam is practically tomorrow! Are you ready?"
    new "El examen es practicamente manana! Estas listo?"

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:187
    old "We barely have any time left before the test!"
    new "Casi no nos queda tiempo antes del examen!"

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:187
    old "The exam is right around the corner... please tell me you studied."
    new "El examen esta a la vuelta de la esquina... por favor, dime que estudiaste."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:195
    old "If you haven't studied yet, now is your last chance."
    new "Si todavia no estudiaste, esta es tu ultima oportunidad."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:195
    old "I'm stressed just thinking about it..."
    new "Ya me estreso solo de pensar en eso..."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:195
    old "We need to buckle down. No more excuses."
    new "Necesitamos enfocarnos. Basta de excusas."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:207
    old "If you fail, I'll tease you first and help you after."
    new "Si repruebas, primero me burlo y despues te ayudo."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:207
    old "You better pass... or I'll have to punish you my way."
    new "Mas te vale pasar... o voy a tener que castigarte a mi manera."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:207
    old "Fail and I get to make fun of you. Deal?"
    new "Reprueba y me gano el derecho de burlarme de ti. Trato?"

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:219
    old "The weather has been weird lately."
    new "El clima ha estado raro ultimamente."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:219
    old "Is it just me or has the temperature been all over the place?"
    new "Soy solo yo o la temperatura esta totalmente descontrolada?"

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:219
    old "I didn't know whether to bring a jacket or sunscreen today."
    new "No sabia si traer una chamarra o bloqueador solar hoy."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:224
    old "One day it's freezing, the next feels like summer again."
    new "Un dia esta helando, al otro parece verano de nuevo."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:224
    old "At this point I just carry everything in my bag."
    new "A estas alturas ya llevo de todo en la mochila."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:224
    old "I swear the campus microclimate is different from the rest of the city."
    new "Juro que el microclima del campus es diferente al del resto de la ciudad."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:241
    old "Have you noticed that teacher who disappears half the class?"
    new "Notaste a ese profesor que desaparece la mitad de la clase?"

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:244
    old "They're either hiding something or just addicted to some game."
    new "O estan escondiendo algo o son adictos a algun juego."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:251
    old "It's probably too late to start studying today, right?"
    new "Probablemente ya es muy tarde para empezar a estudiar hoy, no?"

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:253
    old "We can panic together tomorrow instead."
    new "Podemos entrar en panico juntos manana."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:258
    old "So, how's your day going?"
    new "Y bueno, como va tu dia?"

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:258
    old "So... anything interesting happen today?"
    new "Entonces... paso algo interesante hoy?"

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:258
    old "Hey. You look like you've been thinking about something."
    new "Oye. Parece que estabas pensando en algo."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:258
    old "Random thought, but have you ever just sat here and watched people walk by?"
    new "Pensamiento random, pero alguna vez te has quedado sentado aqui solo viendo a la gente pasar?"

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:264
    old "Nothing special? Yeah, same here."
    new "Nada especial? Si, aqui igual."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:264
    old "It's one of those days, huh? I get it."
    new "Es de esos dias, verdad? Te entiendo."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:264
    old "Sometimes quiet days are the best ones."
    new "A veces los dias tranquilos son los mejores."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:264
    old "Well, at least we're hanging out. That counts for something."
    new "Bueno, al menos estamos juntos. Eso ya vale algo."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:289
    old "Um... h-hey. I think we're in the same class? Academic writing?"
    new "Hm... h-hola. Creo que somos de la misma clase? Escritura academica?"

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:291
    old "Sorry, I'm not great at this... what was your name again?"
    new "Perdon, no soy muy buena en esto... cual era tu nombre?"

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:294
    old "Hey, I know you! We're in academic writing together, right?"
    new "Oye, te conozco! Llevamos escritura academica juntos, no?"

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:296
    old "So... what's your name again? I'm terrible with names."
    new "Entonces... cual era tu nombre? Soy pesima con los nombres."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:308
    old "Yeah, that's me! Nice to properly meet you, [Player.Name]."
    new "Si, soy yo! Mucho gusto en conocerte bien, [Player.Name]."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:312
    old "Oh... that's... that's really sweet, actually."
    new "Ah... eso es... muy tierno, la verdad."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:317
    old "Wow, confident much? ...I kinda like it though."
    new "Wow, todo confiado? ...Pero me gusta eso."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:326
    old "So, [Player.Name], what do you usually do around campus? Like, outside of class."
    new "Entonces, [Player.Name], que haces en el campus? O sea, fuera de clases."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:337
    old "Oh, so that explains... well. Yeah, the gym here is nice!"
    new "Ah, eso explica... bien. Si, el gym de aqui esta bueno!"

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:342
    old "The pool is great! I go there sometimes too. Maybe I'll see you around."
    new "La piscina esta genial! Yo voy a veces tambien. Quien sabe nos encontramos."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:347
    old "Wow, dedicated. That's actually really impressive. Most guys here just mess around."
    new "Wow, dedicado. Eso es realmente impresionante. La mayoria de los chicos de aqui solo flojonean."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:355
    old "I feel like I barely know anything about you. What do you do for fun?"
    new "Siento que casi no se nada de ti. Que haces para divertirte?"

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:375
    old "Photography? That's... actually really cool. I've always thought cameras can be... exciting."
    new "Fotografia? Eso es... muy cool, la verdad. Siempre pense que las camaras pueden ser... emocionantes."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:384
    old "Oh, that's a nice hobby! You any good?"
    new "Ah, que hobby tan padre! Eres bueno?"

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:392
    old "A guy who pushes himself to the limit? ...I can respect that. A lot."
    new "Un chico que se supera? ...Eso lo respeto. Mucho."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:398
    old "That's cool. Staying active is important, I guess."
    new "Cool. Mantenerse activo es importante, creo yo."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:405
    old "You read? That's so... I love that. Most people don't have the patience for it anymore."
    new "Lees? Eso es tan... me encanta. La mayoria de la gente ya no tiene paciencia para eso."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:414
    old "Reading, huh? That's pretty chill. Any recommendations?"
    new "Lectura, eh? Bastante tranquilo. Alguna recomendacion?"

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:419
    old "Swimming is nice. Very... relaxing. And healthy!"
    new "Nadar es bueno. Muy... relajante. Y saludable!"

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:424
    old "Ha, same honestly. At least you're honest about it."
    new "Ja, yo tambien, la verdad. Al menos eres honesto."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:432
    old "Hey, random question... do you work out?"
    new "Oye, pregunta random... haces ejercicio?"

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:443
    old "I could tell. I mean... not in a weird way! You just look... healthy."
    new "Se notaba. O sea... no de forma rara! Solo pareces... saludable."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:445
    old "...Anyway! If you ever want a gym buddy, let me know."
    new "...En fin! Si quieres companera de gym, avisame."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:450
    old "Fair enough. It's hard to stay motivated when you're doing it alone."
    new "Es justo. Es dificil mantener la motivacion cuando lo haces solo."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:451
    old "Maybe having someone to go with would help?"
    new "Tal vez tener a alguien para ir junto ayudaria?"

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:456
    old "What? No! I was just curious!"
    new "Que?! No! Solo tenia curiosidad!"

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:458
    old "...But you know, the gym here is pretty good. Just saying."
    new "...Pero sabes, el gym de aqui esta bastante bien. Solo digo."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:466
    old "So... and this is just me being curious... do you have a girlfriend?"
    new "Entonces... y esto es pura curiosidad mia... tienes novia?"

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:477
    old "Oh! Cool. I mean, not cool that you're alone or anything! Just... good to know."
    new "Ah! Cool. O sea, no cool que estes solo ni nada! Solo... bueno saberlo."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:481
    old "Ah... complicated. I get it. Relationships are messy sometimes."
    new "Ah... complicado. Entiendo. Las relaciones son un desastre a veces."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:487
    old "W-What?! I was just making conversation!"
    new "Q-Que?! Solo estaba haciendo platica!"

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:490
    old "...But I didn't say no."
    new "...Pero no dije que no."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:500
    old "Can I be honest? I actually noticed you before we started talking."
    new "Puedo ser sincera? La verdad te habia notado antes de que empezaramos a hablar."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:503
    old "Not in a creepy way! You just... stand out, I guess."
    new "No de forma rara! Solo... resaltas, creo."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:514
    old "You did? That makes me feel a lot less awkward about saying it."
    new "En serio? Eso me hace sentir mucho menos avergonzada por haber hablado."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:518
    old "Typical. Guys never notice until you spell it out for them."
    new "Tipico. Los chicos nunca se dan cuenta hasta que se lo deletreas."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:520
    old "Well, you know now."
    new "Bueno, ahora ya sabes."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:525
    old "I... okay, that one caught me off guard."
    new "Yo... ok, esa me agarro desprevenida."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:527
    old "You're trouble, aren't you?"
    new "Eres problematico, verdad?"

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:536
    old "Hey, you eaten yet? I was thinking about grabbing something from the cafeteria."
    new "Oye, ya comiste? Estaba pensando en ir por algo al comedor."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:547
    old "Great! I hate eating alone. Come on, let's go."
    new "Genial! Odio comer sola. Andale, vamos."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:551
    old "Wow, playing hard to get with cafeteria food? Bold strategy."
    new "Wow, haciendote el dificil con la comida del comedor? Estrategia arriesgada."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:555
    old "I mean... yeah? Unless you want me to invite the whole campus."
    new "O sea... si? A menos que quieras que invite a todo el campus."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:557
    old "Come on, it's just lunch."
    new "Ya pues, es solo almuerzo."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:566
    old "Hey... something about you is different today. Did you change something?"
    new "Oye... hay algo diferente en ti hoy. Cambiaste algo?"

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:577
    old "I wasn't fishing for compliments! But... thank you."
    new "No estaba pescando cumplidos! Pero... gracias."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:582
    old "I don't know... you seem more confident? Or maybe I'm just paying more attention."
    new "No se... te ves mas seguro? O tal vez solo estoy poniendo mas atencion."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:586
    old "Oh no... want to talk about it? Or we can just hang out, no pressure."
    new "Ay no... quieres hablar de eso? O podemos solo quedarnos aqui, sin presion."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:595
    old "So, have you been talking to anyone else around here? Or am I your only friend?"
    new "Entonces, has hablado con alguien mas por aqui? O soy tu unica amiga?"

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:617
    old "Really? Just me? That's... kind of sweet, actually."
    new "En serio? Solo yo? Eso es... medio tierno, la verdad."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:619
    old "Well, I'm not complaining. More of your attention for me."
    new "Bueno, no me quejo. Mas atencion tuya para mi."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:633
    old "I'm glad you two are getting along. She's one of my favorite people here."
    new "Me alegra que se lleven bien. Ella es de mis personas favoritas aqui."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:639
    old "She's nice to hang around with. Good choice."
    new "Es cool estar con ella. Buena eleccion."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:645
    old "She's fine, I guess. We just don't really click."
    new "Esta bien, supongo. Solo no conectamos mucho."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:651
    old "Let's just say... we don't exactly see eye to eye. Be careful around her."
    new "Digamos que... no nos llevamos muy bien. Ten cuidado con ella."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:661
    old "I think I'm running on coffee more than actual sleep this week."
    new "Creo que estoy funcionando mas a base de cafe que de sueno esta semana."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:661
    old "Coffee is the only thing keeping me functional this semester."
    new "El cafe es lo unico que me mantiene funcional este semestre."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:661
    old "I had three cups before noon. I think that's a record for me."
    new "Tome tres tazas antes del mediodia. Creo que es mi record."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:666
    old "If I fall asleep mid-sentence, just poke me or something."
    new "Si me duermo a media frase, solo picame o algo asi."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:666
    old "At some point the caffeine stops working and you're just drinking warm sadness."
    new "En algun punto la cafeina deja de funcionar y solo estas tomando tristeza caliente."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:666
    old "Want to grab one together later? Misery loves company."
    new "Quieres tomar uno juntos despues? Mal acompanado es mejor que solo."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:680
    old "Do you have a group for that project already?"
    new "Ya tienes grupo para ese proyecto?"

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:681
    old "Because half the campus is just pretending to 'work together' while one person does everything."
    new "Porque la mitad del campus solo finge 'trabajar juntos' mientras una persona hace todo."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:686
    old "Have you tried the cafeteria food today?"
    new "Probaste la comida del comedor hoy?"

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:686
    old "The cafeteria menu is getting more creative... and not in a good way."
    new "El menu del comedor se esta poniendo mas creativo... y no de la buena manera."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:686
    old "I looked at my plate today and genuinely could not identify what I was eating."
    new "Mire mi plato hoy y genuinamente no pude identificar que estaba comiendo."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:691
    old "I'm not sure if it was lunch or a chemistry experiment."
    new "No se si era almuerzo o un experimento de quimica."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:691
    old "We should start a petition for better food. Or just bring our own."
    new "Deberiamos hacer una peticion por mejor comida. O simplemente traer la nuestra."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:691
    old "At least the bread is safe... most of the time."
    new "Al menos el pan es seguro... la mayoria de las veces."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:705
    old "Any plans for the weekend?"
    new "Algun plan para el fin de semana?"

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:707
    old "I'm pretending I'll rest, but we both know I'll just scroll on my phone and panic Sunday night."
    new "Estoy fingiendo que voy a descansar, pero ambos sabemos que voy a estar en el celular y entrar en panico el domingo en la noche."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:713
    old "I opened my phone to check one message and lost thirty minutes."
    new "Abri el celular para ver un mensaje y perdi treinta minutos."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:715
    old "If I ever go missing, I'm probably just trapped in social media again."
    new "Si desaparezco, probablemente estoy atrapada en redes sociales otra vez."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:721
    old "I was almost late to class today."
    new "Casi llegue tarde a clase hoy."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:723
    old "The worst part is, the teacher was even later than me."
    new "Lo peor es que el profesor llego aun mas tarde que yo."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:729
    old "The library is either completely silent or full of chaos, there's no in-between."
    new "La biblioteca o esta completamente en silencio o es puro caos, no hay termino medio."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:731
    old "I kind of like both, depending on my mood."
    new "La verdad me gustan los dos, dependiendo de mi humor."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:737
    old "Did you hear about that party last night?"
    new "Supiste de la fiesta de anoche?"

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:739
    old "Some people showed up to class this morning looking like zombies with hangovers."
    new "Algunas personas llegaron a clase hoy en la manana pareciendo zombis de cruda."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:745
    old "How many hours of sleep did you get?"
    new "Cuantas horas de sueno dormiste?"

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:747
    old "Be honest. Anything above five is considered a luxury here."
    new "Se honesto. Cualquier cosa arriba de cinco ya es un lujo aqui."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:753
    old "Campus rumors spread faster than official announcements."
    new "Los chismes del campus se esparcen mas rapido que los comunicados oficiales."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:755
    old "If the administration wants us to know something, they should leak it as gossip first."
    new "Si la administracion quiere que sepamos algo, deberian filtrarlo como chisme primero."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:761
    old "I don't really like Mr. Johnson. I think he talks like a caveman."
    new "No me cae muy bien el Sr. Johnson. Creo que habla como hombre de las cavernas."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:767
    old "I keep getting these weird messages from someone with an unusual alias."
    new "Me siguen llegando mensajes raros de alguien con un apodo raro."

