    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:2781
    old "As long as nobody gets caught, what's the harm?"
    new "Mientras nadie sea cachado, cual es el problema?"

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:2788
    old "Wait, she has a partner? And you two were... oh my god."
    new "Espera, ella tiene pareja? Y ustedes dos estaban... Dios mio."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:2788
    old "That's so wrong. Her poor partner has no idea..."
    new "Eso esta tan mal. Su pobre pareja no tiene idea..."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:2788
    old "I feel bad just knowing about it. Should I say something?"
    new "Me siento mal solo de saberlo. Deberia decir algo?"

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:2794
    old "I don't want to get involved, but it feels wrong to stay quiet."
    new "No quiero meterme, pero se siente mal quedarme callada."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:2794
    old "Promise me you'd never do that to someone who trusts you."
    new "Prometeme que nunca le harias eso a alguien que confia en ti."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:2794
    old "I couldn't live with that kind of guilt..."
    new "No podria vivir con ese tipo de culpa..."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:2801
    old "The fact that she did it where someone could see... that takes nerve."
    new "El hecho de que lo hiciera donde alguien podria ver... eso es mucho valor."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:2801
    old "I won't lie, there's something thrilling about the risk of getting caught."
    new "No voy a mentir, hay algo emocionante en el riesgo de ser cachado."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:2801
    old "Her partner would lose it if they knew. And honestly, that's kind of exciting."
    new "Su pareja se volveria loca si supiera. Y sinceramente, eso es medio excitante."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:2807
    old "Not saying I approve. Just saying I understand the rush."
    new "No estoy diciendo que lo apruebe. Solo digo que entiendo la adrenalina."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:2807
    old "The danger makes it hotter, doesn't it? Don't look at me like that."
    new "El peligro lo hace todo mas caliente, no? No me mires asi."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:2813
    old "So I saw you with her the other day. Does her partner know?"
    new "Entonces te vi con ella el otro dia. Su pareja sabe?"

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:2813
    old "She's got a partner and she's sneaking around with you? Yikes."
    new "Ella tiene pareja y anda escondiendose contigo? Tenso."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:2813
    old "I'm not going to tell anyone, but... that's messy."
    new "No le voy a decir a nadie, pero... esto es complicado."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:2819
    old "Just be careful. These things always come out eventually."
    new "Solo ten cuidado. Estas cosas siempre salen a la luz al final."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:2819
    old "I'm staying out of it, but don't drag me into your drama."
    new "Me voy a mantener fuera, pero no me metas en tu drama."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:2819
    old "None of my business, I guess. But still... wow."
    new "No es mi asunto, supongo. Pero aun asi... wow."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:2835
    old "You cheated on me with a girl who's ALSO cheating on her partner? You're both terrible."
    new "Me enganaste con una chica que TAMBIEN esta enganando a su pareja? Los dos son pesimos."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:2835
    old "So neither of you has any loyalty. Great. That makes me feel SO much better."
    new "Entonces ninguno de los dos tiene lealtad. Genial. Eso me hace sentir MUCHO mejor."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:2835
    old "I was the only one being faithful in any of this. What a joke."
    new "Yo era la unica siendo fiel en todo esto. Que chiste."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:2841
    old "I feel like an idiot for trusting either of you."
    new "Me siento una idiota por haber confiado en cualquiera de ustedes."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:2841
    old "Two cheaters found each other. I should have seen it coming."
    new "Dos traidores se encontraron. Deberia haberlo visto venir."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:2841
    old "At least I know now. I won't make that mistake again."
    new "Al menos ahora lo se. No voy a cometer ese error otra vez."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:2848
    old "You and her deserve each other. Two backstabbers in one room."
    new "Se merecen el uno al otro. Dos traidores en la misma habitacion."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:2848
    old "You couldn't even cheat with someone single? Real classy."
    new "Ni siquiera pudiste enganar con alguien soltera? Mucha clase."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:2848
    old "Her partner and I both got screwed over. Not the fun kind either."
    new "Su pareja y yo fuimos los dos enganados. Y no del tipo divertido."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:2854
    old "I'm done being angry about it. But I'm NEVER forgetting it."
    new "Ya me canse de estar enojada por eso. Pero NUNCA lo voy a olvidar."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:2854
    old "Next time, don't make promises you can't keep."
    new "La proxima vez, no hagas promesas que no puedes cumplir."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:2860
    old "You cheated on me, and she's cheating on her partner. What a mess."
    new "Me enganaste, y ella esta enganando a su pareja. Que desastre."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:2860
    old "So I walked in on two people who don't care about anyone but themselves."
    new "Entonces cache a dos personas a las que no les importa nadie mas que ellos mismos."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:2860
    old "Her partner doesn't know, I didn't know. Real nice."
    new "Su pareja no sabe, yo no sabia. Muy bonito."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:2866
    old "I just keep asking myself why. Why wasn't I enough?"
    new "Solo me sigo preguntando por que. Por que no era suficiente?"

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:2866
    old "I hope it was worth it. For both of you."
    new "Espero que haya valido la pena. Para los dos."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:2866
    old "I don't even know who to be more angry at. You or her."
    new "Ni se con quien estar mas enojada. Tu o ella."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:2882
    old "I still think about seeing you two out in the open like that. It was... exciting."
    new "Todavia pienso en haberlos visto asi al aire libre. Fue... excitante."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:2882
    old "You really went for it in public. That takes courage. Or insanity."
    new "De verdad fueron a fondo en publico. Eso requiere valor. O locura."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:2882
    old "The fact that anyone could have walked by and seen you two... my heart was racing."
    new "El hecho de que cualquiera podria haber pasado y verlos... mi corazon estaba desbocado."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:2888
    old "If that ever happens again, maybe give me a heads up first. I might want a better view."
    new "Si eso pasa de nuevo, tal vez avisame antes. Puede que quiera una mejor vista."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:2888
    old "I won't lie, I've been thinking about what I saw more than I should."
    new "No voy a mentir, he pensado en lo que vi mas de lo que deberia."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:2888
    old "You know, I wouldn't mind being in that situation myself someday."
    new "Sabes, no me molestaria estar en esa situacion algun dia."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:2896
    old "I can't believe you did that where ANYONE could see! What is wrong with you?!"
    new "No puedo creer que hiciste eso donde CUALQUIERA podia ver! Que te pasa?!"

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:2896
    old "Do you have any idea how embarrassing it was to walk in on that?"
    new "Tienes idea de lo vergonzoso que fue cachar eso?"

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:2896
    old "I still get red just thinking about it. In PUBLIC? Really?"
    new "Todavia me pongo roja solo de pensarlo. En PUBLICO? En serio?"

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:2902
    old "If someone else had seen... I don't even want to think about it."
    new "Si alguien mas hubiera visto... ni quiero pensarlo."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:2902
    old "Please, for the love of everything, get a room next time."
    new "Por favor, por todo lo que es sagrado, consigan un cuarto la proxima vez."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:2902
    old "I'm traumatized. Genuinely traumatized."
    new "Estoy traumatizada. Genuinamente traumatizada."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:2910
    old "I couldn't look away when I saw you two. I know I should have, but..."
    new "No pude apartar la mirada cuando los vi. Se que deberia, pero..."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:2910
    old "You were right there, out in the open. I watched longer than I should admit."
    new "Estaban ahi, al aire libre. Me quede mirando mas de lo que deberia admitir."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:2910
    old "The thrill of watching you without you knowing... I'm not proud of it."
    new "La emocion de verlos sin que supieran... no estoy orgullosa de eso."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:2916
    old "Don't tell anyone I said that. I have a reputation to maintain."
    new "No le digas a nadie que dije esto. Tengo una reputacion que mantener."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:2916
    old "I know it's weird. But I couldn't help myself."
    new "Se que es raro. Pero no pude controlarme."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:2916
    old "Next time... maybe don't be so careless. Or do. Your call."
    new "La proxima vez... tal vez no sean tan descuidados. O si. Tu decides."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:2924
    old "You know I saw you two outside, right? You weren't exactly subtle."
    new "Sabes que los vi alla afuera, verdad? No fueron exactamente discretos."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:2924
    old "Anyone could have seen what you were doing. Were you trying to get caught?"
    new "Cualquiera podria haber visto lo que estaban haciendo. Estaban tratando de que los cacharan?"

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:2924
    old "Doing that out in the open... do you just not care who sees?"
    new "Hacer eso al aire libre... simplemente no te importa quien vea?"

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:2930
    old "I'm not judging. Okay, maybe a little. But seriously, be more careful."
    new "No estoy juzgando. Ok, tal vez un poco. Pero en serio, tengan mas cuidado."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:2930
    old "Just keep it behind closed doors next time, alright?"
    new "Solo mantenganlo a puerta cerrada la proxima vez, si?"

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:2930
    old "I'll pretend I didn't see anything. You're welcome."
    new "Voy a fingir que no vi nada. De nada."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:2945
    old "At the pool? With people potentially around? You've got serious nerve."
    new "En la piscina? Con gente posiblemente cerca? Tienes mucho valor."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:2945
    old "The pool, of all places... the water, the swimsuits... it was like a scene from a movie."
    new "La piscina, justamente la piscina... el agua, los bikinis... parecia escena de pelicula."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:2945
    old "I still think about what I saw by the pool. The wet skin, the heat... wow."
    new "Todavia pienso en lo que vi en la piscina. La piel mojada, el calor... wow."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:2951
    old "Maybe we should go swimming together sometime. See what happens."
    new "Tal vez deberiamos nadar juntos algun dia. Ver que pasa."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:2951
    old "The pool is never going to feel the same after what I saw."
    new "La piscina nunca va a ser la misma despues de lo que vi."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:2958
    old "The pool?! Someone could have been swimming right there!"
    new "La piscina?! Alguien podria haber estado nadando ahi!"

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:2958
