    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:3006
    old "I was SO embarrassed. I dropped my towel and ran."
    new "Me dio TANTA pena. Se me cayo la toalla y sali corriendo."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:3012
    old "I couldn't shower for two days because I was too scared to go back."
    new "No me pude banar por dos dias porque tenia miedo de volver ahi."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:3012
    old "Lock the door next time! If there even IS a lock!"
    new "Pon seguro la proxima vez! Si es que HAY seguro!"

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:3019
    old "The shower, huh? At least you picked somewhere with easy cleanup."
    new "La regadera, eh? Al menos escogiste un lugar facil de limpiar."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:3019
    old "I heard the water running for WAY too long. Now I know why."
    new "Escuche el agua corriendo por MUCHO tiempo. Ahora se por que."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:3019
    old "Showers are practical for that kind of thing. Not judging."
    new "Las regaderas son practicas para ese tipo de cosas. Sin juicios."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:3025
    old "Next time, run the water louder. I could hear everything."
    new "La proxima vez, deja el agua mas fuerte. Te escuchaba todo."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:3025
    old "Just saying... the acoustics in that shower leave nothing to the imagination."
    new "Solo digo... la acustica de esa regadera no deja nada a la imaginacion."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:3032
    old "I walked into the showers and got a LOT more than I bargained for."
    new "Entre a las regaderas y vi MUCHO mas de lo que esperaba."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:3032
    old "You were in the shower with her. I saw. End of story."
    new "Estaban en la regadera juntos. Lo vi. Fin de la historia."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:3032
    old "The shower area is shared, you know. Some of us actually use it to shower."
    new "El area de regaderas es compartida, sabian. Algunos de nosotros realmente la usamos para banarnos."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:3038
    old "I'm going to need some time before I can shower in peace again."
    new "Voy a necesitar un tiempo antes de poder banarme en paz otra vez."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:3038
    old "At least put a towel on the door handle or something. A warning."
    new "Al menos pongan una toalla en la manija o algo asi. Un aviso."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:3038
    old "I'll knock from now on. Trust me."
    new "Voy a tocar la puerta de ahora en adelante. Confien en eso."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:3054
    old "The door was cracked open. I didn't mean to look, but... I did."
    new "La puerta estaba entreabierta. No se suponia que mirara, pero... mire."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:3054
    old "I heard noises from your room. I stood outside longer than I should have."
    new "Escuche ruidos desde tu cuarto. Me quede afuera mas tiempo del que deberia."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:3054
    old "I peeked through the door. I know it's wrong. But I couldn't help it."
    new "Espie por la puerta. Se que esta mal. Pero no pude evitarlo."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:3060
    old "You should really close your door all the way. Or don't. Up to you."
    new "De verdad deberias cerrar la puerta bien. O no. Tu decides."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:3060
    old "I might have seen everything. I might have seen nothing. You'll never know."
    new "Tal vez vi todo. Tal vez no vi nada. Nunca lo sabras."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:3067
