    new "Fui a tu cuarto a preguntarte algo y... la puerta estaba abierta..."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:3067
    old "I didn't mean to see anything! I just knocked and it swung open!"
    new "No se suponia que viera nada! Solo toque y la puerta se abrio!"

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:3067
    old "I've been avoiding your hallway since that day. You know why."
    new "He evitado tu pasillo desde ese dia. Sabes por que."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:3073
    old "The image is burned into my brain. I can't unsee it."
    new "La imagen se quedo grabada en mi cerebro. No puedo des-verla."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:3073
    old "Please just lock your door from now on. For both our sakes."
    new "Por favor, solo cierra con llave de ahora en adelante. Por el bien de los dos."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:3073
    old "I knocked! I swear I knocked!"
    new "Si toque! Juro que toque!"

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:3080
    old "I caught a glimpse when I walked by your room. Nice moves."
    new "Vi de reojo cuando pase por tu cuarto. Buenos movimientos."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:3080
    old "Your room, huh? At least you keep it behind closed doors. Mostly."
    new "Tu cuarto, eh? Al menos mantienes la puerta cerrada. Casi siempre."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:3080
    old "I wasn't snooping. The door was open. Not my fault I have eyes."
    new "No estaba fisgoneando. La puerta estaba abierta. No es mi culpa tener ojos."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:3086
    old "Looked like fun. Maybe I should swing by more often."
    new "Se veia divertido. Tal vez deberia pasar por ahi mas seguido."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:3086
    old "Don't worry, your secret is safe with me. I've got my own."
    new "No te preocupes, tu secreto esta a salvo conmigo. Yo tengo los mios."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:3093
    old "I accidentally walked in on you in your room. I'm still recovering."
    new "Accidentalmente entre a tu cuarto. Todavia me estoy recuperando."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:3093
    old "Your door wasn't fully closed and I saw way more than I wanted to."
    new "Tu puerta no estaba completamente cerrada y vi mucho mas de lo que queria."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:3093
    old "Next time you're... busy... maybe lock the door?"
    new "La proxima vez que estes... ocupado... tal vez cierra con llave?"

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:3099
