    old "I'll text before coming over from now on. Lesson learned."
    new "Voy a mandar mensaje antes de aparecer de ahora en adelante. Leccion aprendida."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:3099
    old "Let's just pretend that never happened. Deal?"
    new "Solo finjamos que esto nunca paso. Sale?"

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:3115
    old "Remember when I watched you two? I still think about it sometimes."
    new "Recuerdas cuando los mire? Todavia pienso en eso a veces."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:3115
    old "I know it's weird that I stayed and watched. But I couldn't look away."
    new "Se que es raro que me haya quedado mirando. Pero no podia apartar los ojos."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:3115
    old "Watching you with her was... educational. Among other things."
    new "Verlos fue... educativo. Entre otras cosas."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:3121
    old "If you ever need an audience again, you know where to find me."
    new "Si necesitan publico de nuevo, saben donde encontrarme."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:3121
    old "I learned a few things just from watching. Want me to demonstrate?"
    new "Aprendi algunas cosas solo mirando. Quieres que te las demuestre?"

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:3121
    old "Honestly, it was the hottest thing I've ever seen. Don't let it go to your head."
    new "Sinceramente, fue lo mas caliente que he visto. No dejes que se te suba."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:3130
    old "Seeing you with her made me realize something about myself."
    new "Verlos me hizo darme cuenta de algo sobre mi misma."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:3130
    old "I stayed and watched because... I liked the idea of being seen too."
    new "Me quede y mire porque... me gusto la idea de ser vista tambien."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:3130
    old "If I was the one with you, I wouldn't mind someone watching us."
