    new "Mi primera vez fue porque te suplique que fueras mas profundo. No fue exactamente como me lo imagine..."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:4597
    old "I went from 'just rubbing' to losing my virginity in the same session. That's... something."
    new "Fui de 'solo frotar' a perder la virginidad en la misma sesion. Eso es... algo."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:4597
    old "I always thought my first time would be romantic. Instead I begged for it during 'just the tip'..."
    new "Siempre pense que mi primera vez seria romantica. En cambio, suplique durante 'solo la puntita'..."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:4604
    old "From tip to full sex... and I was the one who asked for it. I'm a terrible girlfriend."
    new "De la puntita al sexo completo... y fui yo quien lo pidio. Soy una novia terrible."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:4604
    old "I cheated because I couldn't stop at the tip. And the worst part? I'd do it again."
    new "Engane porque no pude parar en la puntita. Y lo peor? Lo haria de nuevo."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:4611
    old "Remember when I told you to forget the tip and just fuck me? Best decision I ever made."
    new "Recuerdas cuando te dije que olvidaras la puntita y simplemente me cogieras? Mejor decision de mi vida."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:4611
    old "From the tip to all the way in. I knew that's where it was going. I wanted it."
    new "De la puntita hasta el fondo. Sabia que iba a acabar asi. Lo queria."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:4611
    old "That escalation from tip to sex? I planned that. You just didn't know it yet."
    new "Esa escalada de la puntita al sexo? Yo lo planee. Solo que tu no sabias todavia."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:4617
    old "I still can't believe I begged you to go deeper that time... I was so caught up in the moment..."
    new "Todavia no puedo creer que te suplique que fueras mas profundo esa vez... estaba tan metida en el momento..."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:4617
    old "From 'just the tip' to... everything. I never thought I'd be that kind of girl."
    new "De 'solo la puntita' a... todo. Nunca pense que seria ese tipo de chica."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:4617
    old "I think about that time a lot. When I couldn't stop at the tip. It was so intense..."
    new "Pienso mucho en esa vez. Cuando no pude parar en la puntita. Fue tan intenso..."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:4623
    old "Remember when we went from 'just the tip' to full on sex? I fell for the oldest trick in the book."
    new "Recuerdas cuando fuimos de 'solo la puntita' a sexo completo? Cai en el truco mas viejo del mundo."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:4623
    old "I said 'just the tip' and then begged for more. Classic, right?"
    new "Dije 'solo la puntita' y despues suplique por mas. Clasico, no?"

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:4623
    old "That escalation from tip to sex... I knew it was coming. I just didn't want to admit it."
    new "Esa escalada de la puntita al sexo... sabia que iba a pasar. Solo no queria admitirlo."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:4640
    old "I keep telling myself it was a mistake. But then I remember how it felt and I want to do it again."
    new "Me sigo diciendo que fue un error. Pero luego recuerdo como se sintio y quiero hacerlo de nuevo."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:4667
    old "This is weird, isn't it? Talking to you like nothing happened. I keep wanting to cry and I don't even know why anymore."
    new "Esto es raro, no? Platicar contigo como si nada hubiera pasado. Dan ganas de llorar y ya ni se por que."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:4667
    old "I practiced what I was going to say to you in the mirror this morning. And now I can't remember a single word."
    new "Ensaye lo que te iba a decir en el espejo esta manana. Y ahora no puedo recordar una sola palabra."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:4667
    old "I keep catching myself staring at you and then looking away. Old habits, I guess. Sorry. I don't mean to make it weird."
    new "Me cacho mirandote fijamente y luego desviando la mirada. Viejos habitos, supongo. Perdon. No quiero hacer esto incomodo."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:4673
    old "...I miss how easy things used to be between us. Before everything got complicated."
    new "...Extrano como todo era facil entre nosotros. Antes de que todo se complicara."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:4673
    old "...Do you think we'll ever be able to talk without this... heaviness?"
    new "...Crees que algun dia vamos a poder platicar sin este... peso?"

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:4673
    old "...I wonder if laughing with you will ever feel normal again."
    new "...Me pregunto si reirme contigo se va a sentir normal otra vez algun dia."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:4680
    old "So... are we going to keep doing this thing where we pretend everything is fine? Because I'm over it."
    new "Entonces... vamos a seguir fingiendo que todo esta bien? Porque yo ya me canse."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:4680
    old "Look, this whole 'polite small talk' act is killing me. Can we just acknowledge the elephant in the room and move on?"
    new "Mira, toda esta actuacion de 'platica educada' me esta matando. Podemos simplemente reconocer al elefante en la habitacion y seguir adelante?"

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:4680
    old "I'd rather we be real with each other than play this stupid game of 'everything is normal.' It's not. We both know it."
    new "Prefiero que seamos honestos que jugar este juego tonto de 'todo esta normal'. No lo esta. Los dos lo sabemos."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:4685
    old "...Whatever. At least we're talking. That's more than I expected, honestly."
    new "...Da igual. Al menos estamos hablando. Ya es mas de lo que esperaba, sinceramente."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:4685
    old "...I'm not going to pretend I'm over it. But I'm here. So that's something."
    new "...No voy a fingir que lo supere. Pero estoy aqui. Asi que ya es algo."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:4685
    old "...Just don't bore me with small talk. If we're going to talk, let's actually TALK."
    new "...Solo no me aburras con platica casual. Si vamos a platicar, vamos a PLATICAR de verdad."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:4692
    old "You know what's funny? I still instinctively save a seat for you at lunch. And then I remember we're not... that anymore."
    new "Sabes que es gracioso? Todavia te guardo un lugar en el almuerzo por instinto. Y luego recuerdo que ya no somos... eso."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:4692
    old "I found one of your things in my room the other day. I held it for like ten minutes before putting it away. Pathetic, right?"
    new "Encontre algo tuyo en mi cuarto el otro dia. Lo estuve sosteniendo como diez minutos antes de guardarlo. Patetico, no?"

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:4692
    old "Sometimes I forget for a second. And then I remember what you did and it hits me all over again. Like a punch to the stomach."
    new "A veces se me olvida por un segundo. Y luego recuerdo lo que hiciste y me pega todo de nuevo. Como un golpe en el estomago."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:4697
    old "...Sorry. I didn't mean to make this heavy. I'm just... adjusting."
    new "...Perdon. No queria poner esto pesado. Solo estoy... ajustandome."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:4697
    old "...Ignore me. I'm being dramatic. We said we'd move on. So let's move on."
    new "...Ignorame. Estoy siendo dramatica. Dijimos que ibamos a seguir adelante. Asi que hagamoslo."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:4697
    old "...I promised myself I wouldn't bring it up again. But it's hard when every conversation feels like walking on glass."
    new "...Me prometi a mi misma que no iba a tocar el tema de nuevo. Pero es dificil cuando cada conversacion se siente como caminar sobre vidrio."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:4704
    old "You know, for two people who messed everything up, we're doing surprisingly okay as friends."
    new "Sabes, para dos personas que lo arruinaron todo, nos va sorprendentemente bien como amigos."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:4704
    old "It's actually kind of nice not having to pretend anymore. No rules, no expectations. Just... this."
    new "La verdad hasta es bueno no tener que fingir mas. Sin reglas, sin expectativas. Solo... esto."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:4704
    old "Funny how things work out. We were terrible at dating. But this? This might actually work."
    new "Chistoso como funcionan las cosas. Eramos pesimos de novios. Pero esto? Esto podria funcionar de verdad."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:4709
    old "...Don't read too much into that. I'm just saying it's less stressful."
    new "...No lo sobreanalices. Solo digo que es menos estresante."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:4709
    old "...I mean, the sex was great. But the drama? Not worth it. This is better."
    new "...O sea, el sexo era genial. Pero el drama? No valia la pena. Esto es mejor."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:4709
    old "...Who knows. Maybe we needed to crash and burn to figure out what actually works between us."
    new "...Quien sabe. Tal vez necesitabamos explotar para descubrir lo que realmente funciona entre nosotros."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:4716
    old "I keep starting conversations in my head with you. Full dialogues. And then when I actually see you I just say 'hey.'"
    new "Me la paso empezando conversaciones contigo en mi cabeza. Dialogos completos. Y luego cuando te veo, solo digo 'hola'."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:4716
    old "Is it just me or do our silences feel louder now? Like every pause is loaded with all the things we're not saying."
    new "Soy solo yo o nuestros silencios se sienten mas ruidosos ahora? Tipo, cada pausa esta cargada con todo lo que no estamos diciendo."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:4716
    old "I ran into you at the hallway yesterday and my heart did that stupid thing where it speeds up. I hate that it still does that."
    new "Me tope contigo en el pasillo ayer y mi corazon hizo esa cosa tonta de acelerarse. Odio que todavia haga eso."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:4722
    old "...Anyway. I'm glad we can at least talk. Even if it's about nothing."
    new "...En fin. Me alegra que al menos podamos platicar. Aunque sea de nada."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:4722
    old "...I guess this is our new normal. It's not great. But it's not terrible."
    new "...Creo que este es nuestro nuevo normal. No es genial. Pero no es terrible."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:4722
    old "...One day at a time, right?"
    new "...Un dia a la vez, no?"

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:4739
    old "I used to tell you everything. Like, EVERYTHING. Even the embarrassing stuff. I don't know who to tell those things to now."
    new "Te contaba todo. Tipo, TODO. Hasta las cosas vergonzosas. Ya no se a quien contarle esas cosas."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:4739
    old "My friends keep asking me if I'm okay. And I say yes. But I'm lying. I don't want to explain it because then I'd have to relive it."
    new "Mis amigas me siguen preguntando si estoy bien. Y digo que si. Pero estoy mintiendo. No quiero explicar porque tendria que revivir todo."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:4739
    old "I had a dream about you last night. We were still together and nothing bad happened. Waking up was the worst part."
    new "Tuve un sueno contigo anoche. Todavia estabamos juntos y nada malo habia pasado. Despertar fue la peor parte."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:4745
    old "...Sorry for dumping this on you. You're probably the last person I should be telling."
    new "...Perdon por echarte todo esto encima. Probablemente eres la ultima persona a la que deberia contarselo."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:4745
    old "...I know I shouldn't say this stuff to you. But who else would understand?"
    new "...Se que no deberia decirte estas cosas. Pero quien mas lo entenderia?"

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:4751
    old "You know what pisses me off the most? It's not that you did it. It's that I didn't see it coming. I'm usually smarter than that."
    new "Sabes que es lo que mas me enoja? No es lo que hiciste. Es que no lo vi venir. Normalmente soy mas lista que eso."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:4751
    old "I keep going over it in my head. Trying to figure out when I lost control of the situation. And I can't pinpoint it. That drives me insane."
    new "Lo sigo repasando en mi cabeza. Tratando de descubrir cuando perdi el control de la situacion. Y no puedo identificarlo. Eso me vuelve loca."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:4751
    old "People think I'm over it because I'm not crying about it. But that's not how I work. My anger is quiet. And it lasts."
    new "La gente cree que lo supere porque no estoy llorando. Pero no es asi como funciono. Mi enojo es silencioso. Y dura."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:4757
    old "...But holding grudges is exhausting. And I have better things to do with my energy."
    new "...Pero guardar rencor es agotador. Y tengo cosas mejores que hacer con mi energia."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:4757
    old "...At least I learned something. Trust has to be earned. Not given. I won't make that mistake again."
    new "...Al menos aprendi algo. La confianza hay que ganarla. No se regala. No voy a cometer ese error otra vez."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:4763
    old "I keep asking myself if there were signs I missed. If I was too trusting. Too blind. Too in love to see what was happening."
    new "Me sigo preguntando si habia senales que no vi. Si fui muy confiada. Muy ciega. Muy enamorada como para ver lo que estaba pasando."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:4763
    old "The worst part isn't the betrayal. It's the doubt. Now I question everything. Every conversation, every memory. Was any of it real?"
    new "Lo peor no es la traicion. Es la duda. Ahora cuestiono todo. Cada conversacion, cada recuerdo. Algo de eso fue real?"

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:4763
    old "I gave you my trust like it was nothing. Because to me, it WAS nothing. It was automatic. Now I realize how expensive that was."
    new "Te di mi confianza como si fuera nada. Porque para mi, ERA nada. Era automatico. Ahora me doy cuenta de cuanto costo."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:4768
    old "...I'll trust again someday. But never the same way I trusted you. That version of me is gone."
    new "...Voy a confiar de nuevo algun dia. Pero nunca de la misma forma que confie en ti. Esa version de mi ya no existe."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:4768
    old "...I don't say this to hurt you. I say it because you should know what you broke."
    new "...No digo esto para lastimarte. Lo digo porque deberias saber lo que rompiste."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:4774
    old "Trust? Please. Neither of us was built for that. We just pretended long enough to believe our own lie."
    new "Confianza? Por favor. Ninguno de los dos fue hecho para eso. Solo fingimos lo suficiente como para creernos nuestra propia mentira."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:4774
    old "Honestly? The whole 'exclusive' thing was always going to end this way. People like us aren't wired for monogamy."
    new "Sinceramente? Todo esto de la 'exclusividad' siempre iba a acabar asi. Personas como nosotros no fueron hechas para la monogamia."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:4774
    old "I'm not even mad about the trust thing. I'm mad we wasted time pretending we were something we're not."
    new "Ni estoy enojada por la confianza. Estoy enojada de que perdimos tiempo fingiendo ser algo que no somos."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:4779
    old "...At least now there's no illusion to maintain. That's freeing, in a weird way."
    new "...Al menos ahora no hay ilusion que mantener. Eso es liberador, de una forma rara."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:4779
    old "...We're better off being honest about what we want. Even if what we want is messy."
    new "...Estamos mejor siendo honestos sobre lo que queremos. Aunque lo que queramos sea un desastre."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:4785
    old "You know what I think about sometimes? How I used to fall asleep feeling safe because I knew you were mine. That feeling is gone now."
    new "Sabes en que pienso a veces? En como solia dormirme sintiendome segura porque sabia que eras mio. Esa sensacion se fue."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:4785
    old "I trusted you with the ugly parts of me. The insecurities, the fears, the stuff I never show anyone. And then you went and proved them all right."
    new "Confie en ti con las partes feas de mi. Las inseguridades, los miedos, las cosas que nunca le muestro a nadie. Y luego fuiste y probaste que todas tenian razon."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:4785
    old "It's not just that you cheated. It's that you made me feel stupid for believing you wouldn't. THAT'S what stings."
    new "No es solo que me enganaste. Es que me hiciste sentir idiota por creer que no lo harias. ESO es lo que duele."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:4791
    old "...But life goes on. And honestly? I'm stronger now. Even if the strength came from a shitty place."
    new "...Pero la vida sigue. Y sinceramente? Soy mas fuerte ahora. Aunque la fuerza haya venido de un lugar horrible."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:4791
    old "...I don't need you to fix it. I just needed you to hear it. That's enough."
    new "...No necesito que lo arregles. Solo necesitaba que escucharas. Eso es suficiente."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:4807
    old "Remember when we first started talking and I was so nervous I couldn't even make eye contact? God, that feels like a lifetime ago."
    new "Recuerdas cuando empezamos a hablar y yo estaba tan nerviosa que ni podia verte a los ojos? Wow, parece una vida atras."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:4807
    old "I was organizing my photos and found the ones from when we were together. I stared at them way longer than I should have."
    new "Estaba organizando mis fotos y encontre las de cuando estabamos juntos. Me quede viendolas mucho mas tiempo del que deberia."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:4807
    old "You know what I miss? The stupid stuff. Like how you'd make fun of my sneezes. Nobody does that anymore. It's dumb, but I miss it."
    new "Sabes que extrano? Las cosas tontas. Como que te burlabas de mis estornudos. Nadie mas hace eso. Es tonto, pero lo extrano."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:4813
    old "...Sorry. I shouldn't bring up the good times. It makes the bad part hurt worse."
    new "...Perdon. No deberia traer los buenos momentos. Hace que lo malo duela mas."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:4813
    old "...Ugh, why did I say that. Now I'm getting emotional again. Ignore me."
    new "...Ugh, por que dije eso. Ahora me estoy poniendo emocional otra vez. Ignorame."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:4813
    old "...And now I'm sad. Great. This is why I shouldn't talk to you about feelings."
    new "...Y ahora estoy triste. Genial. Por eso no deberia hablar de sentimientos contigo."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:4820
    old "I was cleaning my room and found that thing you left behind. Almost threw it out. ...Almost."
    new "Estaba limpiando mi cuarto y encontre esa cosa que dejaste. Casi la tiro a la basura. ...Casi."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:4820
    old "Someone mentioned your name the other day and I had this whole internal debate about whether I still care. The fact that I debated it at all is annoying."
    new "Alguien menciono tu nombre el otro dia y tuve un debate interno completo sobre si todavia me importas. El hecho de que lo haya debatido ya es irritante."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:4820
    old "You know what I think about sometimes? How confident I was that we'd work. How sure I was. I'm never that sure about anything anymore."
    new "Sabes en que pienso a veces? En lo segura que estaba de que iba a funcionar. Que tan segura estaba. Nunca mas estoy tan segura de nada."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:4825
    old "...Don't get sentimental on me. I'm not going soft. I'm just... observing."
    new "...No te pongas sentimental conmigo. No me estoy ablandando. Solo estoy... observando."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:4825
    old "...That came out more emotional than I intended. Pretend I said something tough instead."
    new "...Eso salio mas emocional de lo que pretendia. Finge que dije algo rudo."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:4825
    old "...Anyway. Past is past. But it was a good past. Before it wasn't."
    new "...En fin. El pasado es pasado. Pero fue un buen pasado. Antes de que dejara de serlo."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:4832
    old "I wrote you a letter once. Before everything fell apart. I was going to give it to you on our anniversary. I burned it last week."
    new "Te escribi una carta una vez. Antes de que todo se derrumbara. Te la iba a dar en nuestro aniversario. La queme la semana pasada."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:4832
    old "Remember when you told me I was the most important person in your life? I believed that so completely. I built my entire world around those words."
    new "Recuerdas cuando me dijiste que yo era la persona mas importante de tu vida? Lo crei tan completamente. Construi mi mundo entero alrededor de esas palabras."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:4832
    old "There are songs I can't listen to anymore. Places I can't go without thinking of you. You're everywhere and nowhere at the same time."
    new "Hay canciones que ya no puedo escuchar. Lugares a los que no puedo ir sin pensar en ti. Estas en todos lados y en ningun lado al mismo tiempo."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:4837
    old "...I'll stop living in the past eventually. But for now, the memories are all I have left of who I used to be with you."
    new "...Voy a dejar de vivir en el pasado eventualmente. Pero por ahora, los recuerdos son todo lo que me queda de quien era contigo."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:4837
    old "...Don't worry. I'm not trying to guilt you. I'm just... processing. Out loud. Sorry."
    new "...No te preocupes. No estoy tratando de culparte. Solo estoy... procesando. En voz alta. Perdon."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:4843
    old "You know what I actually miss? The sneaking around. The thrill of it. The relationship part was whatever, but the GAME? That was fun."
    new "Sabes de que realmente extrano? Lo escondido. La emocion. La relacion en si da igual, pero el JUEGO? Eso si era divertido."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:4843
    old "Honestly the best part of us dating was the sex. The emotional stuff was just... packaging. At least now we can skip the wrapping paper."
    new "Sinceramente, la mejor parte de ser novios era el sexo. La parte emocional era solo... el envoltorio. Al menos ahora podemos saltarnos el papel de regalo."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:4843
    old "Remember when we tried to be 'serious'? Like, actually committed? That lasted what, a month before one of us got bored? Classic us."
    new "Recuerdas cuando intentamos ser 'serios'? Tipo, realmente comprometidos? Duro que, un mes antes de que uno de los dos se aburriera? Tipico de nosotros."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:4848
    old "...Don't take that the wrong way. I enjoyed it. I just enjoy THIS more. Less pretending."
    new "...No lo tomes a mal. Lo disfrute. Solo disfruto ESTO mas. Menos actuacion."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:4848
    old "...We had fun. We'll have fun again. Just... differently. And honestly, probably better."
    new "...La pasamos bien. Vamos a pasarla bien de nuevo. Solo... diferente. Y sinceramente, probablemente mejor."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:4854
    old "I was thinking about the first time you made me laugh. Like, REALLY laugh. The kind where your stomach hurts. I haven't laughed like that since."
    new "Estaba pensando en la primera vez que me hiciste reir. Tipo, DE VERDAD reir. De esas que te duele la panza. No me he reido asi desde entonces."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:4854
    old "There's a coffee shop we used to go to together. I went back yesterday. Sat in the same spot. Ordered the same thing. It tasted different."
    new "Hay un cafe al que ibamos juntos. Volvi ayer. Me sente en el mismo lugar. Pedi lo mismo. El sabor era diferente."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:4854
    old "Isn't it weird how you can know everything about someone and then suddenly not know them at all? Like they're a stranger wearing a familiar face."
    new "No es raro como puedes saber todo de alguien y de repente ya no conocerlos? Como si fuera un extrano usando una cara familiar."

