    new "Los libros antiguos son fascinantes."
    old "Especially once you notice that some of what's in them isn't as fictional as it looks."
    new "Especialmente cuando notas que parte de lo que contienen no es tan ficticio como parece."
    old "I went through a phase where I studied symbols and runes."
    new "Pasé por una fase donde estudié símbolos y runas."
