translate es strings:

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:6765
    old "I grew up down South, sugar."
    new "Crecí en el Sur, cariño."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:6765
    old "You learn a few things real early down there. Mostly how to handle the heat and folks who talk too much."
    new "Allá uno aprende algunas cosas desde muy temprano. Sobre todo a aguantar el calor y a la gente que habla de más."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:6765
    old "My aunt practically raised me."
    new "Mi tía prácticamente me crió."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:6765
    old "That woman could fix a fence, bake a pie and put a grown man in his place, all before lunch."
    new "Esa mujer podía arreglar una cerca, hornear un pastel y poner a un hombre hecho y derecho en su lugar, todo antes del almuerzo."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:6765
    old "I miss some things from home."
    new "Extraño algunas cosas de casa."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:6765
    old "Mostly the food. Nobody up here knows what real cornbread is supposed to taste like."
    new "Sobre todo la comida. Nadie por aquí sabe a qué debe saber un pan de maíz de verdad."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:6765
    old "Don't mess with a southern girl, darlin'."
    new "No te metas con una chica sureña, corazón."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:6765
    old "We smile real sweet right up until we don't."
    new "Sonreímos muy dulce... justo hasta que dejamos de hacerlo."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:6765
    old "I used to ride every mornin' back home."
    new "Allá en casa montaba a caballo cada mañana."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:6765
    old "Nothin' clears your head like a good horse and an open field. This campus has neither."
    new "Nada despeja la mente como un buen caballo y un campo abierto. Este campus no tiene ninguna de las dos cosas."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:6765
    old "My aunt called this mornin'."
    new "Mi tía llamó esta mañana."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:6765
    old "Asked if I'm eatin' right, sleepin' right and goin' to church. Two outta three, sugar."
    new "Me preguntó si estoy comiendo bien, durmiendo bien y yendo a la iglesia. Dos de tres, cariño."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:6765
    old "My family's... complicated."
    new "Mi familia es... complicada."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:6765
    old "Let's just leave it at that for now, sugar."
    new "Dejémoslo así por ahora, cariño."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:6765
    old "I spent a few years livin' with a bunch of folks who ended up bein' my family."
    new "Pasé unos años viviendo con un montón de gente que terminó siendo mi familia."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:6765
    old "We weren't kin. Back then that didn't make a lick of difference."
    new "No éramos parientes. En ese entonces eso no hacía ni la más mínima diferencia."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:6765
    old "That big old house was always full of people."
    new "Esa casona siempre estaba llena de gente."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:6765
    old "You never got a minute of privacy. I miss it more than I'd ever tell 'em."
    new "Nunca tenías ni un minuto de privacidad. Lo extraño más de lo que jamás les diría."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:6765
    old "I learned early that family don't always mean blood."
    new "Aprendí desde temprano que la familia no siempre es de sangre."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:6765
    old "Sometimes it's just the folks who show up when it counts."
    new "A veces es simplemente la gente que aparece cuando cuenta."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:6765
    old "There's a girl I grew up with in that house."
    new "Hay una chica con la que crecí en esa casa."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:6765
    old "We ain't related, but she's my sister in every way that counts. She'd tease me about you for a month."
    new "No somos parientes, pero es mi hermana en todo lo que importa. Me molestaría por ti durante un mes."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:6765
    old "I've lived with folks a whole lot stranger than anybody on this campus."
    new "He vivido con gente muchísimo más rara que cualquiera en este campus."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:6765
    old "Trust me, sugar. Y'all are downright normal."
    new "Créeme, cariño. Ustedes son de lo más normales."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:6765
    old "I went through a phase where I couldn't touch folks without worryin' what might happen."
    new "Pasé por una etapa en la que no podía tocar a nadie sin preocuparme por lo que podía pasar."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:6765
    old "Long story. Took me years to feel easy about it."
    new "Es una larga historia. Me tomó años sentirme tranquila con eso."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:6765
    old "You got no idea how hard it is to keep your distance when everybody wants a hug."
    new "No tienes idea de lo difícil que es mantener la distancia cuando todos quieren un abrazo."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:6765
    old "I got real good at the side-step. Olympic level."
    new "Me volví experta en esquivar. Nivel olímpico."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:6765
    old "People always ask about my gloves."
    new "La gente siempre pregunta por mis guantes."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:6765
    old "Habit, mostly. I wore 'em so long my hands feel naked without 'em."
    new "Costumbre, más que nada. Los usé tanto tiempo que mis manos se sienten desnudas sin ellos."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:6765
    old "I spent years learnin' to keep a lid on certain things about me."
    new "Pasé años aprendiendo a mantener bien tapadas ciertas cosas de mí."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:6765
    old "Some days the lid still rattles."
    new "Hay días en que la tapa todavía se sacude."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:6765
    old "There was a time I figured somethin' was real wrong with me."
    new "Hubo un tiempo en que pensaba que algo andaba muy mal conmigo."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:6765
    old "Took a long while 'fore I felt anywhere near normal."
    new "Pasó mucho tiempo antes de que me sintiera mínimamente normal."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:6765
    old "I don't do hospitals, sugar."
    new "Los hospitales no son lo mío, cariño."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:6765
    old "White rooms, cold hands, folks pokin' at you. No, thank you."
    new "Cuartos blancos, manos frías, gente picándote por todos lados. No, gracias."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:6765
    old "There was a boy once. Charmin' as sin, and I cared about him a whole lot."
    new "Hubo un chico una vez. Encantador como el pecado, y lo quería muchísimo."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:6765
    old "Just never the way he wanted. Took us both a long time to see it."
    new "Solo que nunca de la forma en que él quería. A los dos nos tomó mucho tiempo verlo."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:6765
    old "He used to shuffle a deck of cards while he talked to me."
    new "Solía barajar un mazo de cartas mientras hablaba conmigo."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:6765
    old "Drove me crazy. The good kind of crazy and the bad kind."
    new "Me volvía loca. De la forma buena y de la mala."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:6765
    old "When I was younger, I fell in with a woman I figured for a second mama."
    new "Cuando era más joven, me junté con una mujer que creí que sería como una segunda mamá."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:6765
    old "She wasn't. Took me a long time to see it, and even longer to quit missin' her."
    new "No lo era. Me tomó mucho tiempo verlo, y todavía más dejar de extrañarla."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:6765
    old "I spent a good chunk of my teens away from home."
    new "Pasé buena parte de mi adolescencia lejos de casa."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:6765
    old "Wasn't exactly the easiest stretch of my life. I came out the other side, though."
    new "No fue precisamente la etapa más fácil de mi vida. Pero salí adelante."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:6765
    old "I had somethin' complicated with a boy I liked a whole lot."
    new "Tuve algo complicado con un chico que me gustaba muchísimo."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:6765
    old "Likin' somebody don't mean it's gonna work. Took me a long time to learn that."
    new "Que te guste alguien no significa que vaya a funcionar. Me tomó mucho tiempo aprenderlo."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:6765
    old "Him and me had a real complicated history."
    new "Él y yo tuvimos una historia bien complicada."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:6765
    old "Close enough to hurt, never close enough to hold. That about sums it up."
    new "Lo bastante cerca para doler, nunca lo bastante cerca para abrazarnos. Eso lo resume."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:6765
    old "I learned to fight years back, from folks who didn't believe in goin' easy."
    new "Aprendí a pelear hace años, con gente que no creía en ir con calma."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:6765
    old "Now I just come here to remind my body it still remembers."
    new "Ahora solo vengo aquí a recordarle a mi cuerpo que todavía se acuerda."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:6765
    old "Somebody told me a long time ago that you train so you never have to find out."
    new "Alguien me dijo hace mucho que uno entrena para nunca tener que averiguarlo."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:6765
    old "I still hear it every time I think about skippin' a session."
    new "Todavía lo escucho cada vez que pienso en saltarme un entrenamiento."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:6765
    old "We had a trainin' room back at that old house."
    new "Teníamos un cuarto de entrenamiento en esa casona."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:6765
    old "Folks called it the danger room, and they weren't kiddin'."
    new "La gente le decía la Sala de Peligro, y no bromeaban."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:6765
    old "I can throw a punch, sugar."
    new "Sé dar un buen golpe, cariño."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:6765
    old "I just hope I never have to show you."
    new "Solo espero nunca tener que demostrártelo."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:6765
    old "I spent a few years training every day."
    new "Pasé algunos años entrenando todos los días."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:6765
    old "You pick up habits. Like checking every exit when I walk into a room."
    new "Uno agarra costumbres. Como revisar todas las salidas cuando entro a un lugar."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:6765
    old "I learned to fight before I learned to relax."
    new "Aprendí a pelear antes que a relajarme."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:6765
    old "Still working on the second one."
    new "Todavía estoy trabajando en lo segundo."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:6765
    old "My training wasn't exactly the kind of extracurricular parents recommend."
    new "Mi entrenamiento no era precisamente el tipo de actividad extracurricular que recomiendan los padres."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:6765
    old "No certificate. Just bruises and one very disappointed instructor."
    new "Sin certificado. Solo moretones y un instructor muy decepcionado."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:6765
    old "I've had instructors way scarier than any professor here."
    new "He tenido instructores mucho más aterradores que cualquier profesor de aquí."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:6765
    old "One was seven feet tall and gave speeches about honor. Every. Single. Day."
    new "Uno medía más de dos metros y daba discursos sobre el honor. Todos. Los. Días."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:6765
    old "I've been on a couple of... group projects."
    new "He estado en un par de... proyectos en equipo."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:6765
    old "The kind where things blow up if one person doesn't follow the plan."
    new "Del tipo en que las cosas explotan si una persona no sigue el plan."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:6765
    old "Short hair is practical."
    new "El cabello corto es práctico."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:6765
    old "You'd be amazed how often long hair gets grabbed in a fight."
    new "Te sorprendería lo seguido que te agarran el cabello largo en una pelea."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:6765
    old "I've got a bit of an explosive temper."
    new "Tengo un temperamento algo explosivo."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:6765
    old "Figuratively. ...Mostly."
    new "En sentido figurado. ...Casi siempre."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:6765
    old "Rule one: keep fragile things away from me."
    new "Regla número uno: mantén las cosas frágiles lejos de mí."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:6765
    old "I have a bad track record with them."
    new "No tengo buen historial con ellas."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:6765
    old "I learned to control my anger."
    new "Aprendí a controlar mi enojo."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:6765
    old "The walls are grateful."
    new "Las paredes lo agradecen."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:6765
    old "No, I'm not going to explode."
    new "No, no voy a explotar."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:6765
    old "Probably."
    new "Probablemente."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:6765
    old "There was a time everything I touched ended up broken."
    new "Hubo un tiempo en que todo lo que tocaba terminaba roto."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:6765
    old "I'm better now. Ask the vending machine. Actually, don't."
    new "Ya estoy mejor. Pregúntale a la máquina expendedora. Mejor no."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:6765
    old "Let's just say I had an... explosive adolescence."
    new "Digamos que tuve una adolescencia... explosiva."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:6765
    old "Some of the scorch marks are probably still there."
    new "Algunas marcas de quemadura probablemente siguen ahí."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:6765
    old "I build my own computers."
    new "Armo mis propias computadoras."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:6765
    old "Store-bought ones don't survive me. Long story."
    new "Las de tienda no me sobreviven. Larga historia."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:6765
    old "I don't buy cheap electronics."
    new "No compro electrónicos baratos."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:6765
    old "They fry. Around me, specifically. Don't ask."
    new "Se queman. Cerca de mí, específicamente. No preguntes."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:6765
    old "Someone in my building had 'password' as their wifi password."
    new "Alguien en mi edificio tenía 'contraseña' como contraseña del wifi."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:6765
    old "Had. I fixed it. They'll never know. You're welcome, humanity."
    new "Tenía. Lo arreglé. Nunca lo sabrán. De nada, humanidad."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:6765
    old "I fixed the campus printer last week."
    new "Arreglé la impresora del campus la semana pasada."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:6765
    old "Nobody asked. It just offended me."
    new "Nadie me lo pidió. Simplemente me ofendía."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:6765
    old "I had some problems with electricity when I was younger."
    new "Tuve algunos problemas con la electricidad cuando era más joven."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:6765
    old "Nothing I want to repeat."
    new "Nada que quiera repetir."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:6765
    old "I once had to work with a guy who couldn't shut up for five minutes."
    new "Una vez tuve que trabajar con un tipo que no podía callarse ni cinco minutos."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:6765
    old "I'd have preferred another fight."
    new "Habría preferido otra pelea."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:6765
    old "Trust me. I've met people way more annoying than you."
    new "Créeme. He conocido gente mucho más molesta que tú."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:6765
    old "You're not even top ten. Don't make it a goal."
    new "Ni siquiera entras en el top diez. No lo conviertas en una meta."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:6765
    old "I once had to babysit a grown man who acted like a toddler."
    new "Una vez tuve que hacer de niñera de un hombre adulto que actuaba como un niño pequeño."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:6765
    old "He talked to people who weren't even there. Don't recommend it."
    new "Hablaba con gente que ni siquiera estaba ahí. No lo recomiendo."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:6765
    old "I was on a job once that should've taken ten minutes."
    new "Una vez estuve en un trabajo que debió tomar diez minutos."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:6765
    old "If one person had followed the plan. One. He did not."
    new "Si una persona hubiera seguido el plan. Una. Él no lo hizo."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:6765
    old "Somebody once told me I had the coolest name ever."
    new "Una vez alguien me dijo que tenía el nombre más genial del mundo."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:6765
    old "Then he didn't stop talking for two hours. Don't become that guy."
    new "Luego no dejó de hablar en dos horas. No te conviertas en ese tipo."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:6765
    old "My %(pl)s is the only person who can talk me into being social."
    new "Mi %(pl)s es la única persona que logra convencerme de socializar."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:6765
    old "I still don't know how %(pp)s does it. Witchcraft, probably."
    new "Todavía no sé cómo lo hace. Brujería, seguramente."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:6765
    old "My %(pl)s is way more optimistic than me."
    new "Mi %(pl)s es mucho más optimista que yo."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:6765
    old "I don't know how %(pp)s manages it. It's exhausting to watch."
    new "No sé cómo lo logra. Cansa solo de verl%(ga)s."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:6765
    old "My %(pl)s is used to the way I am."
    new "Mi %(pl)s ya está acostumbrad%(ga)s a cómo soy."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:6765
    old "That's rarer than you'd think."
    new "Eso es más raro de lo que crees."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:6765
    old "My %(pl)s says I need to smile more."
    new "Mi %(pl)s dice que necesito sonreír más."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:6765
    old "I disagree."
    new "No estoy de acuerdo."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:6765
    old "We met during a really weird time of my life."
    new "Nos conocimos en una etapa muy rara de mi vida."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:6765
    old "%(Pp)s said hi to me like we were already friends. Turns out %(pp)s was right. Annoying."
    new "%(Pp)s me saludó como si ya tuviéramos una amistad. Resulta que tenía razón. Qué fastidio."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:6765
    old "I dated a guy in high school. A complete rebel."
    new "Salí con un chico en la secundaria. Un rebelde total."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:6765
    old "Hated school, hated rules. I liked him, in a way. It just took me a while to figure out which way."
    new "Odiaba la escuela, odiaba las reglas. Me gustaba, en cierto modo. Solo me tomó un tiempo descubrir de qué modo."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:7545
    old "Have you seen %(name)s lately? Baggy hoodies, skipping coffee, that little glow. I have a theory."
    new "¿Has visto a %(name)s últimamente? Sudaderas holgadas, sin café, ese brillito. Tengo una teoría."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:7545
    old "%(name)s ran out of class looking green this morning. Either the cafeteria struck again or something's up."
    new "%(name)s salió corriendo de clase esta mañana, toda verde. O la cafetería atacó otra vez o algo está pasando."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:7545
    old "Call it goth intuition, but %(name)s is hiding something under all those loose shirts."
    new "Llámalo intuición gótica, pero %(name)s esconde algo bajo todas esas blusas holgadas."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:7545
    old "So %(name)s is pregnant. Like, visibly. There is no hoodie on Earth big enough anymore."
    new "Así que %(name)s está embarazada. O sea, se nota. Ya no existe sudadera en la Tierra lo bastante grande."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:7545
    old "Did you see %(name)s today? That is not a food baby. I wonder who the dad is."
    new "¿Viste a %(name)s hoy? Eso no es panza de comida. Me pregunto quién será el papá."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:7545
    old "%(name)s waddled past me in the hall. I almost offered to carry her books. Almost."
    new "%(name)s pasó junto a mí en el pasillo caminando como pingüino. Casi le ofrecí cargar sus libros. Casi."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:7545
    old "%(name)s and her %(pl)s are having a baby, huh? Wild. They don't strike me as the crib-shopping type."
    new "Así que %(name)s y su %(pl)s van a tener un bebé, ¿eh? Qué locura. No me parecen del tipo que va a comprar cunas."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:7545
    old "I saw %(name)s with that belly. Her %(pl)s must be freaking out. In a good way. Probably."
    new "Vi a %(name)s con esa panza. Su %(pl)s debe estar enloqueciendo. En el buen sentido. Probablemente."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:7545
    old "Somebody should warn %(name)s's %(pl)s that babies don't come with an off switch."
    new "Alguien debería advertirle a la pareja de %(name)s que los bebés no vienen con botón de apagado."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:7545
    old "So. %(name)s is pregnant. And I happen to know who's been keeping her company. Anything you want to tell me?"
    new "Entonces. %(name)s está embarazada. Y da la casualidad de que sé quién le ha estado haciendo compañía. ¿Algo que quieras contarme?"

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:7545
    old "Funny thing about %(name)s's belly. I can count, you know. And I know where you've been."
    new "Qué curioso lo de la panza de %(name)s. Sé contar, ¿sabes? Y sé por dónde has andado."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:7545
    old "%(name)s is showing, and you've gone very quiet about it. The 'I did that' kind of quiet. Don't even try to deny it."
    new "A %(name)s ya se le nota, y tú te quedaste muy callado al respecto. Ese silencio de 'fui yo'. Ni intentes negarlo."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:7545
    old "Sugar, have you noticed %(name)s lately? Loose tops, turning down coffee. I've got a feeling."
    new "Cariño, ¿te has fijado en %(name)s últimamente? Blusas holgadas, rechazando el café. Tengo un presentimiento."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:7545
    old "%(name)s about lost her breakfast in the hall today. Poor thing. I wonder if it's what I think it is."
    new "%(name)s casi devuelve el desayuno en el pasillo hoy. Pobrecita. Me pregunto si será lo que creo."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:7545
    old "Something's different about %(name)s. She's got that glow my aunt always talked about."
    new "Hay algo distinto en %(name)s. Tiene ese brillo del que mi tía siempre hablaba."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:7545
    old "Well, there's no hiding it now. %(name)s is expecting. That belly says it all."
    new "Bueno, ya no hay forma de ocultarlo. %(name)s está esperando. Esa panza lo dice todo."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:7545
    old "Did you see %(name)s? Bless her heart, she's carrying that baby like a champ. I wonder who the daddy is."
    new "¿Viste a %(name)s? Pobrecita, lleva ese bebé como una campeona. Me pregunto quién será el papá."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:7545
    old "%(name)s let me feel the baby kick today. I ain't gonna lie, I teared up a little."
    new "%(name)s me dejó sentir cómo pateaba el bebé hoy. No voy a mentir, se me salieron unas lagrimitas."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:7545
    old "%(name)s and her %(pl)s are having a baby. I hope they know what they're in for."
    new "%(name)s y su %(pl)s van a tener un bebé. Espero que sepan en lo que se están metiendo."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:7545
    old "I saw %(name)s's %(pl)s carrying her bag for her today. That's sweet. That's how it should be."
    new "Hoy vi a la pareja de %(name)s cargándole la bolsa. Qué lindo. Así debe ser."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:7545
    old "A baby on the way for %(name)s and her %(pl)s. Lord, time moves fast around here."
    new "Un bebé en camino para %(name)s y su %(pl)s. Señor, el tiempo vuela por aquí."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:7545
    old "So %(name)s is pregnant. And I know you two have been close, sugar. Real close. Is it yours?"
    new "Así que %(name)s está embarazada. Y sé que ustedes dos han estado cerca, cariño. Muy cerca. ¿Es tuyo?"

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:7545
    old "I saw %(name)s's belly today, and I did some thinking about who's been around her. You got something to say?"
    new "Hoy vi la panza de %(name)s y me puse a pensar en quién ha andado cerca de ella. ¿Tienes algo que decir?"

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:7545
    old "%(name)s is carrying a baby, and I've got a pretty good idea whose. I hope you're doing right by her."
    new "%(name)s está esperando un bebé, y tengo una idea bastante clara de quién es. Espero que te estés portando bien con ella."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:7545
    old "%(name)s has been wearing hoodies in this heat and skipping gym. Something's off."
    new "%(name)s anda con sudadera con este calor y faltando al gimnasio. Algo no cuadra."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:7545
    old "%(name)s threw up behind the bleachers. Twice. I'm not a doctor, but I can do math."
    new "%(name)s vomitó detrás de las gradas. Dos veces. No soy doctora, pero sé sumar."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:7545
    old "Is it just me, or is %(name)s hiding something? She flinched when I mentioned her jeans."
    new "¿Soy yo o %(name)s esconde algo? Se sobresaltó cuando mencioné sus jeans."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:7545
    old "%(name)s is pregnant. Very pregnant. You can see it from across the quad."
    new "%(name)s está embarazada. Muy embarazada. Se nota desde el otro lado del patio."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:7545
    old "So %(name)s has a whole human in there now. Who's the dad? Not that I care."
    new "Así que %(name)s tiene un humano entero ahí dentro. ¿Quién es el papá? No es que me importe."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:7545
    old "%(name)s asked me to carry her bag. I did it. If you tell anyone, you die."
    new "%(name)s me pidió que le cargara la bolsa. Lo hice. Si le cuentas a alguien, te mueres."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:7545
    old "%(name)s and her %(pl)s are having a kid. Better them than me."
    new "%(name)s y su %(pl)s van a tener un bebé. Mejor ellos que yo."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:7545
    old "I saw %(name)s's %(pl)s reading a baby book in the library. Absolutely terrified. Good."
    new "Vi a la pareja de %(name)s leyendo un libro sobre bebés en la biblioteca. Con cara de pánico absoluto. Bien."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:7545
    old "%(name)s is showing. Her %(pl)s keeps grinning like an idiot. It's unbearable."
    new "A %(name)s ya se le nota. Su %(pl)s no deja de sonreír como idiota. Es insoportable."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:7545
    old "%(name)s is pregnant. And I know you've been sleeping with her. Do the math for me."
    new "%(name)s está embarazada. Y sé que te has estado acostando con ella. Haz la cuenta por mí."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:7545
    old "Saw %(name)s's belly. Saw your face when she walked by. You're not subtle."
    new "Vi la panza de %(name)s. Vi tu cara cuando pasó. No eres nada sutil."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:7545
    old "So you knocked up %(name)s. Wow. Congratulations on making everything more complicated."
    new "Así que embarazaste a %(name)s. Vaya. Felicidades por complicarlo todo."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:7545
    old "H-have you noticed %(name)s lately? She's been wearing really loose clothes, and she looks so tired..."
    new "¿T-te has fijado en %(name)s últimamente? Anda con ropa muy holgada y se ve tan cansada..."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:7545
    old "%(name)s got sick in the lab today. She said it was nothing, but the symptoms match something I read..."
    new "%(name)s se sintió mal en el laboratorio hoy. Dijo que no era nada, pero los síntomas coinciden con algo que leí..."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:7545
    old "I don't want to gossip, but... I think %(name)s might be hiding something. Statistically, it fits."
    new "No quiero chismear, pero... creo que %(name)s podría estar ocultando algo. Estadísticamente, encaja."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:7545
    old "%(name)s is pregnant! I-I mean, it's obvious now. I hope she's doing okay..."
    new "¡%(name)s está embarazada! Q-quiero decir, ya es obvio. Espero que esté bien..."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:7545
    old "I saw %(name)s today and her belly is so big already. I wonder who the father is..."
    new "Hoy vi a %(name)s y su panza ya está tan grande. Me pregunto quién será el padre..."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:7545
    old "I offered %(name)s my seat in the lecture hall. She looked so relieved. Carrying a baby must be exhausting."
    new "Le ofrecí mi asiento a %(name)s en el auditorio. Se veía tan aliviada. Cargar un bebé debe ser agotador."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:7545
    old "%(name)s and her %(pl)s are going to be parents! That's... wow. That's so grown up."
    new "¡%(name)s y su %(pl)s van a ser papás! Eso es... guau. Qué maduro."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:7545
    old "I saw %(name)s's %(pl)s buying baby clothes downtown. It was kind of adorable."
    new "Vi a la pareja de %(name)s comprando ropa de bebé en el centro. Fue algo adorable."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:7545
    old "%(name)s and her %(pl)s must be so nervous. I would be. I'd make so many lists."
    new "%(name)s y su %(pl)s deben estar tan nerviosos. Yo lo estaría. Haría un montón de listas."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:7545
    old "U-um... %(name)s is pregnant. And I know you two have been... together. Is it... yours?"
    new "E-este... %(name)s está embarazada. Y sé que ustedes dos han estado... juntos. ¿Es... tuyo?"

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:7545
    old "I saw %(name)s's belly. And I know about you and her. I-I'm not judging! I just... noticed."
    new "Vi la panza de %(name)s. Y sé lo de ustedes dos. ¡N-no estoy juzgando! Solo... me di cuenta."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:7545
    old "%(name)s is having a baby, and I think I know whose it is... you should be nice to her, okay?"
    new "%(name)s va a tener un bebé, y creo que sé de quién es... deberías ser amable con ella, ¿sí?"

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:7545
    old "Have you noticed %(name)s lately? Loose clothes, always tired. I think something's going on."
    new "¿Te has fijado en %(name)s últimamente? Ropa holgada, siempre cansada. Creo que algo está pasando."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:7545
    old "%(name)s got sick in the hallway this morning. I have a guess about why."
    new "%(name)s se sintió mal en el pasillo esta mañana. Tengo una sospecha de por qué."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:7545
    old "%(name)s is pregnant. You can't miss it anymore."
    new "%(name)s está embarazada. Ya no hay forma de no notarlo."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:7545
    old "Did you see %(name)s? That belly is getting big. I wonder who the father is."
    new "¿Viste a %(name)s? Esa panza está creciendo. Me pregunto quién será el padre."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:7545
    old "%(name)s and her %(pl)s are having a baby. Big changes for them."
    new "%(name)s y su %(pl)s van a tener un bebé. Grandes cambios para ellos."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:7545
    old "I saw %(name)s's %(pl)s fussing over her today. It was kind of sweet."
    new "Hoy vi a la pareja de %(name)s consintiéndola por todo. Fue algo tierno."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:7545
    old "%(name)s is pregnant. And I know you two have been close. Is there something I should know?"
    new "%(name)s está embarazada. Y sé que ustedes dos han estado cerca. ¿Hay algo que debería saber?"

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:7545
    old "I saw %(name)s's belly. I think we both know who's responsible."
    new "Vi la panza de %(name)s. Creo que los dos sabemos quién es el responsable."

