translate es strings:

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:2139
    old "Speaking of which... {hint}I do have a %(pl)s{/hint}. %(Pp)s's really sweet."
    new "Hablando de eso... {hint}sí tengo %(pl)s{/hint}. %(Pp)s es muy dulce."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:2139
    old "{hint}I'm taken{/hint}, actually. %(Pp)s's a good one."
    new "{hint}Ya estoy con alguien{/hint}, la verdad. %(Pp)s es un buen partido."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:2757
    old "I can't believe I did that... {hint}my %s has no idea{/hint}."
    new "No puedo creer que hice eso... {hint}mi %s no tiene idea{/hint}."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:2757
    old "What we did... {hint}it can't happen again{/hint}. %(Pp)s'd be devastated."
    new "Lo que hicimos... {hint}no puede volver a pasar{/hint}. %(Pp)s quedaría destrozad%(ga)s."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:2766
    old "%(Pp)s {hint}trusts me completely{/hint}. And I keep betraying that trust with you."
    new "%(Pp)s {hint}confía en mí por completo{/hint}. Y yo sigo traicionando esa confianza contigo."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:2766
    old "Every time I see my %s, {hint}I feel sick{/hint}. But I still want you."
    new "Cada vez que veo a mi %s, {hint}me dan náuseas{/hint}. Pero todavía te deseo."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:2776
    old "My %(pl)s is {hint}so clueless{/hint}. %(Pp)s has no idea about us."
    new "Mi %(pl)s es {hint}tan despistad%(ga)s{/hint}. %(Pp)s no tiene idea de lo nuestro."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:2776
    old "Honestly? {hint}What %(pp)s doesn't know won't hurt %(po)s{/hint}."
    new "¿Sinceramente? {hint}Si %(pp)s no se entera, a %(po)s no le duele{/hint}."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:3663
    old "My %(pl)s doesn't know I joined you two. And %(pp)s never will."
    new "Mi %(pl)s no sabe que me uní a ustedes dos. Y %(pp)s nunca lo sabrá."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:3663
    old "That was wild. Two people at once. My %s could never."
    new "Eso fue una locura. Dos personas a la vez. Mi %s jamás podría."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:3663
    old "Joining you and her was the most exciting thing I've done behind %(poss)s back."
    new "Unirme a ti y a ella fue lo más excitante que he hecho a espaldas de %(po)s."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:3669
    old "%(Pp)s thinks I was studying. If only %(pp)s knew."
    new "%(Pp)s cree que estaba estudiando. Si %(pp)s supiera..."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:3750
    old "I keep thinking about what we did... %s trusts you. And I helped you betray her."
    new "No dejo de pensar en lo que hicimos... %s confía en ti. Y yo te ayudé a traicionarla."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:3750
    old "I haven't been able to sleep... what we did to %s was terrible. I feel so guilty."
    new "No he podido dormir... lo que le hicimos a %s fue terrible. Me siento tan culpable."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:3750
    old "Do you even feel bad about what we did? Because I can't stop thinking about %s..."
    new "¿Al menos te sientes mal por lo que hicimos? Porque yo no puedo dejar de pensar en %s..."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:3758
    old "I keep replaying what we did... right behind %s's back. It was exciting."
    new "Sigo repasando lo que hicimos... justo a espaldas de %s. Fue excitante."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:3758
    old "Tell me... does %s have any idea? The secret makes it so much better."
    new "Dime... ¿%s tiene alguna idea? El secreto lo hace mucho mejor."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:3765
    old "I've been thinking about what happened between us... %s can never know. Promise me."
    new "He estado pensando en lo que pasó entre nosotros... %s nunca puede saberlo. Prométemelo."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:3765
    old "I feel terrible about %s... but I also can't stop thinking about you."
    new "Me siento fatal por %s... pero tampoco puedo dejar de pensar en ti."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:3772
    old "What if someone saw us? What if %s finds out? I'm so scared..."
    new "¿Y si alguien nos vio? ¿Y si %s se entera? Tengo tanto miedo..."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:3772
    old "I keep checking if %s is looking at me weird... does she know?"
    new "Sigo fijándome si %s me mira raro... ¿lo sabrá?"

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:3779
    old "Part of me wants %s to find out... is that messed up?"
    new "Una parte de mí quiere que %s se entere... ¿eso es muy retorcido?"

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:3779
    old "The fact that %s could walk in at any moment made it so much hotter."
    new "Que %s pudiera entrar en cualquier momento lo hizo mucho más caliente."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:3787
    old "What we did was intense... and the fact that %s has no idea makes it better."
    new "Lo que hicimos fue intenso... y que %s no tenga idea lo hace mejor."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:3787
    old "I don't feel bad. If %s can't keep you satisfied, someone else will."
    new "No me siento mal. Si %s no puede tenerte satisfecho, alguien más lo hará."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:3787
    old "If you're going to cheat on %s... at least you picked someone worth it."
    new "Si vas a engañar a %s... al menos elegiste a alguien que vale la pena."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:3794
    old "About what happened... %s can't find out. You know that, right?"
    new "Sobre lo que pasó... %s no puede enterarse. Lo sabes, ¿verdad?"

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:3794
    old "I've been thinking about us... and about %s. She doesn't deserve this."
    new "He estado pensando en nosotros... y en %s. Ella no se merece esto."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:3794
    old "Just so we're clear... that was a one-time thing. %s can never know."
    new "Solo para que quede claro... eso fue cosa de una sola vez. %s nunca puede saberlo."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:3809
    old "We keep doing this... %s is going to find out eventually. And it'll destroy her."
    new "Seguimos haciendo esto... %s se va a enterar tarde o temprano. Y eso la va a destrozar."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:3809
    old "I look at %s and I feel sick. She has no idea what I've been doing with you."
    new "Miro a %s y me dan náuseas. No tiene idea de lo que he estado haciendo contigo."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:3817
    old "How many times now? %s still has no clue~ We're getting good at this."
    new "¿Cuántas veces van ya? %s todavía no tiene ni idea~ Nos estamos volviendo buenos en esto."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:3817
    old "Every time is better than the last. Poor %s doesn't know what she's missing."
    new "Cada vez es mejor que la anterior. Pobre %s, no sabe lo que se pierde."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:3817
    old "At this point, I'm basically your second girlfriend. %s just doesn't know~"
    new "A estas alturas, soy prácticamente tu segunda novia. %s solo no lo sabe~"

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:3825
    old "We keep coming back to each other. %s clearly isn't enough for you."
    new "Siempre volvemos el uno al otro. Está claro que %s no te basta."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:3825
    old "I've stopped feeling guilty. If %s can't keep you satisfied, that's her problem."
    new "Dejé de sentirme culpable. Si %s no puede tenerte satisfecho, es su problema."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:3832
    old "We can't keep doing this to %s... but I don't want to stop either."
    new "No podemos seguir haciéndole esto a %s... pero tampoco quiero parar."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:3840
    old "Every time we do it somewhere risky, I imagine %s walking in. It's terrifying and amazing."
    new "Cada vez que lo hacemos en algún lugar arriesgado, me imagino a %s entrando. Es aterrador e increíble."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:3840
    old "The more we do this, the more public I want it. Let %s find us. I don't care anymore."
    new "Mientras más lo hacemos, más en público lo quiero. Que %s nos encuentre. Ya no me importa."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:3848
    old "I can't help it... every time you come to me, I just want more. %s isn't giving you enough."
    new "No puedo evitarlo... cada vez que vienes a mí, solo quiero más. %s no te está dando suficiente."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:3848
    old "Does %s let you do what I let you do? I doubt it~"
    new "¿%s te deja hacer lo que yo te dejo? Lo dudo~"

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:3848
    old "I keep thinking about the taste of you... while %s has no clue."
    new "No dejo de pensar en tu sabor... mientras %s no tiene ni idea."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:3856
    old "Sometimes I wonder what you do with %s... and I get jealous. And turned on."
    new "A veces me pregunto qué haces con %s... y me pongo celosa. Y caliente."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:3856
    old "Do you think about me when you're with %s? Because I think about you two together..."
    new "¿Piensas en mí cuando estás con %s? Porque yo pienso en ustedes dos juntos..."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:3864
    old "%s is going to find out if we keep doing this... are you okay with that?"
    new "%s se va a enterar si seguimos con esto... ¿estás bien con eso?"

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:3864
    old "How long do you think we can keep this from %s?"
    new "¿Cuánto tiempo crees que podamos ocultarle esto a %s?"

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:3879
    old "You should just dump %s already. We both know who you really want."
    new "Deberías dejar a %s de una vez. Los dos sabemos a quién quieres de verdad."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:3879
    old "I wonder if %s knows she's sharing you. Probably not. That's the fun part~"
    new "Me pregunto si %s sabe que te está compartiendo. Seguro que no. Eso es lo divertido~"

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:3879
    old "At this point, you're basically mine. %s is just a placeholder."
    new "A estas alturas, prácticamente eres mío. %s solo es de relleno."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:3887
    old "I love you... but I hate what we're doing to %s. She deserves better."
    new "Te amo... pero odio lo que le estamos haciendo a %s. Se merece algo mejor."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:3904
    old "%s can't give you what I can. We both know it."
    new "%s no puede darte lo que yo te doy. Los dos lo sabemos."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:3911
    old "Every time I see you with %s... it hurts. When will you choose me?"
    new "Cada vez que te veo con %s... me duele. ¿Cuándo me vas a elegir?"

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:3919
    old "Honestly? I want %s to catch us. I want her to see what she's losing."
    new "¿Sinceramente? Quiero que %s nos atrape. Quiero que vea lo que está perdiendo."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:3919
    old "The whole campus probably knows by now. And I don't care. %s will find out eventually."
    new "Todo el campus ya debe saberlo a estas alturas. Y no me importa. %s se va a enterar tarde o temprano."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:3927
    old "Promise me there's no evidence of us. If %s ever finds photos or messages..."
    new "Prométeme que no hay ninguna prueba de lo nuestro. Si %s alguna vez encuentra fotos o mensajes..."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:3927
    old "Delete everything. Every text, every call. %s can NEVER have proof."
    new "Borra todo. Cada mensaje, cada llamada. %s NUNCA puede tener pruebas."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:3927
    old "I'm paranoid that someone recorded us at some point... %s would destroy me."
    new "Me da paranoia que alguien nos haya grabado en algún momento... %s me destruiría."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:3935
    old "We've done it everywhere at this point... %s has walked past every place we've been together."
    new "A estas alturas ya lo hicimos en todas partes... %s ha pasado por cada lugar donde hemos estado juntos."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:3935
    old "Next time, I want to do it somewhere %s goes every day. Mark my territory~"
    new "La próxima vez, quiero hacerlo en algún lugar al que %s va todos los días. Marcar mi territorio~"

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:3943
    old "Does %s swallow? Because I do. Every. Single. Time."
    new "¿%s se lo traga? Porque yo sí. Todas. Las. Veces."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:3943
    old "You keep coming back to me because %s doesn't give you everything. I do~"
    new "Siempre vuelves a mí porque %s no te da todo. Yo sí~"

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:3943
    old "I know why you cheat on %s. She can't handle you like I can."
    new "Sé por qué engañas a %s. Ella no puede contigo como yo."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:3951
    old "At this point, you should just be honest with %s. Or with me."
    new "A estas alturas, deberías ser honesto con %s. O conmigo."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:3951
    old "You keep coming back. I keep saying yes. %s keeps not knowing."
    new "Tú sigues volviendo. Yo sigo diciendo que sí. %s sigue sin saberlo."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:5137
    old "Remember when I asked you to put the tip in? I still can't believe I did that... my %(pl)s would kill me if %(pp)s knew."
    new "¿Recuerdas cuando te pedí que metieras la puntita? Todavía no puedo creer que lo hice... mi %(pl)s me mataría si supiera."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:5137
    old "That time I begged for 'just the tip'... I think about it more than I should. Especially when I'm with %(po)s."
    new "Esa vez que te supliqué 'solo la puntita'... pienso en eso más de lo que debería. Sobre todo cuando estoy con %(po)s."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:5185
    old "I let you go all the way when I said 'just the tip'. My %s has no idea how far I've fallen."
    new "Te dejé llegar hasta el fondo cuando dije 'solo la puntita'. Mi %s no tiene idea de lo bajo que he caído."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:5185
    old "Remember when I said 'forget the tip, go all the way'? I think about that every time I see my %s."
    new "¿Recuerdas cuando dije 'olvida la puntita, ve hasta el fondo'? Pienso en eso cada vez que veo a mi %s."

    # game/scripts/Chat/ChitChat.rpy:5227
    old "I cheated on %(po)s because of you. Because I couldn't control myself. Are you happy?"
